        {
          "id": "two_intervals_11_3",
          "description": "Two full update intervals of bed::PointwiseIsostasy at mid-radius cell (11,3) (mid-radius, H0 = 499.48437574022 m): load_last starts at the initial load H0 = 499.48437574022 m (init_impl), update 1 consumes load_avg_1 = 649.48437574022 m and update 2 load_avg_2 = 799.48437574022 m, each with uplift = (bed_out - bed_in)/dt_beddef, dt_beddef = 100 '365day years' (stage1/dumps/bed/columns.csv). bed_out_1 = -f*150 m, bed_out_2 = -f*300 m (a load change is fully compensated in the single update that follows it).",
